abstract: >-
  Comprehensive software supply chain security framework: SBOM generation and queryability (CycloneDX/SPDX), artifact signing with Sigstore/Cosign, SLSA build provenance, dependency security, third-party risk management, and runtime admission control. Directly implements EO 14028 Section 4 mandates including the SBOM requirement.
keywords:
  - sbom
  - slsa
  - sigstore
  - cosign
  - supply-chain-security
  - eo-14028
  - cyclonedx
  - spdx
